WEBVTT

00:09:29.997 --> 00:09:33.482
Antonio: Here lies your brother no
better than the earth he lies upon.

00:09:33.506 --> 00:09:35.281
Sebastian: Draw thy sword.

00:09:35.305 --> 00:09:38.890
And I, the king, shall love thee.

00:09:38.914 --> 00:09:44.300
Prospera: I will plague
them all, even to roaring.

00:09:46.133 --> 00:09:50.706
Ariel: I have made you mad.

00:09:56.874 --> 00:09:59.895
Prospera: We are such stuff
as dreams are made on.

00:09:59.919 --> 00:10:04.106
and our little life
is rounded with a sleep.